{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the island of speed! Here you'll find exciting top-down racing, fast-paced gameplay and plenty of opportunities to customize your car.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose between classes of cars - from agile sports cars to rugged pickup trucks. Win races, earn rewards and invest them in improving the performance of your vehicle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take part in three unique modes, each of which will require your maximum concentration and skill. Beautiful stylized graphics immerse you in the atmosphere of an exotic racing island, where every track is a challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Top view and dynamic racing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Choice between racing cars and pickup trucks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Three unique game modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Appearance customization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Vehicle upgrades and performance enhancements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Bright stylized graphics</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3680460?t=1745428407","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3680460?t=1745428407","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680460/29f6a75e440059c930c4a0e3f99401687bd73573/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745428407","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680460/29f6a75e440059c930c4a0e3f99401687bd73573/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745428407","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the island of speed! Here you'll find exciting top-down racing, fast-paced gameplay and plenty of opportunities to customize your car.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose between classes of 